            "name": "Paypal Cancel unclaimed payout item",
            "description": {
              "content": "Cancels an unclaimed payout item, by ID. If no one claims the unclaimed item within 30 days, the API automatically returns the funds to the sender. Use this call to cancel the unclaimed item before the automatic 30-day refund. You can cancel payout items with a <code>transaction_status</code> of <code>UNCLAIMED</code>.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
